{
  "schema_version": "report-evidence/1",
  "source_sha256": "45d3821d9d3ad71b86f046c68b5305f455f05226cb1460a2ace5d9ff9fc51351",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0001",
      "text": "Same-block donation can indefinitely DoS Tokenomics.checkpoint()",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 64,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0002",
      "text": "### Summary",
      "start": 66,
      "end": 77,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0003",
      "text": "Every successful service donation updates `lastDonationBlockNumber = block.number`.",
      "start": 78,
      "end": 161,
      "line": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0004",
      "text": "`Tokenomics.checkpoint()` unconditionally reverts if called in the same block as the most recent donation.",
      "start": 162,
      "end": 268,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0005",
      "text": "An attacker can watch the mempool for `checkpoint()` attempts and submit a donation in the same block (front-run/race), causing checkpoint to revert every time. This can delay epoch finalization indefinitely.",
      "start": 269,
      "end": 477,
      "line": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0006",
      "text": "## Root cause",
      "start": 478,
      "end": 491,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0007",
      "text": "A global “no donations this block” latch is enforced via revert:",
      "start": 492,
      "end": 556,
      "line": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0008",
      "text": "And donations always set it:",
      "start": 557,
      "end": 585,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0009",
      "text": "## Impact",
      "start": 586,
      "end": 595,
      "line": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0010",
      "text": "- Epoch settlement liveness failure: `checkpoint()` can be delayed arbitrarily long.",
      "start": 596,
      "end": 680,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0011",
      "text": "- Cascading delays:",
      "start": 681,
      "end": 700,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0012",
      "text": "- reward/top-up accounting finalization,",
      "start": 703,
      "end": 743,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0013",
      "text": "- staking incentive pot updates,",
      "start": 746,
      "end": 778,
      "line": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0014",
      "text": "- any automation depending on timely epoch progression.",
      "start": 781,
      "end": 836,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0015",
      "text": "## Attack scenario",
      "start": 837,
      "end": 855,
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0016",
      "text": "1) Keeper submits `checkpoint()` when epoch window is open.",
      "start": 856,
      "end": 915,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0017",
      "text": "2) Attacker submits a donation tx with higher priority.",
      "start": 916,
      "end": 971,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0018",
      "text": "3) Donation mined first → sets `lastDonationBlockNumber`.",
      "start": 972,
      "end": 1029,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0019",
      "text": "4) `checkpoint()` mined in same block → reverts `SameBlockNumberViolation()`.",
      "start": 1030,
      "end": 1107,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_45d3821d9d3a_0020",
      "text": "5) Attacker repeats indefinitely.",
      "start": 1108,
      "end": 1141,
      "line": 21
    }
  ]
}
